description	"000

A torturous droid equipped with a wide variety of sadistic tools. 

^2Weaponry:
- Torturous Melee
-- Cripples/Slips/Poisons/Tracks
-- Drains/Force Focuses
-- 15% Faster Movement
-- High Damage
- Dioxis Dart Rifle (3)
-- DC Carbine (3)
-- Tracks/Slips/Poisons/Cripples/Force Focuses
-- Mag Reload
-- 55% Less Damage
- Knockout Canister (3)
-- Frag Grenade
-- Blinds/Sonic Shocks/Slips/Knocksdown/Poisons
- Submission Mines (4)
-- Lifts/Tracks/Blinds/Disarms/Freezes/Force Focuses
-- 20% More Damage
- Stun Baton (2)

^8Attributes:
- Anti Mind Trick (2)
- Stat Viewer
- Healing (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Close Combat (3)
- Environmential Protection (1)
- Blast Armor
- Mag Plating
- Toxic Taunt

^3Abilities:
- Enemy Scanner ^3[CS4]
- Grav-Wrist Laser ^3[CS2]
-- 50% Less Damage, Pulls On Hit
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Lethal Tracking Darts (6) ^3[CS3]
-- Applies Force Focus/Slippery/Blind/Cripple/Poison
- Resource Dispenser (1) ^3[USE In Melee]
- Disguise (1) ^3[Style Swap In Melee]"
